				<r3d:description language="eng">The Leibniz Data Manager (LDM) is a scientific repository for research data from the fields of science and technology.
The service supports a better re-usability of research data for scientific projects. The LDM fosters the management and access to heterogeneous research data publications and assists researchers in the selection of relevant data sets for their respective disciplines.
The LDM currently offers the following functions for the visualization of research data:
· Supports data collections and publications with different formats.
· Different views on the same data set (2D and 3D support).
· Visualization of Auto CAD files.
· Jupyter Notes for demonstrating live code.
· RDF Description of data collections.</r3d:description>
